@CIE.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5205

### Check API and database connectivity
GET {{CIE.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Capture a student prompt
POST {{CIE.Api_HostAddress}}/api/prompts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "ST001",
  "sessionId": "SESSION001",
  "promptText": "What is dependency injection in ASP.NET Core?"
}

###

### List captured prompts
GET {{CIE.Api_HostAddress}}/api/prompts
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a prompt by ID
GET {{CIE.Api_HostAddress}}/api/prompts/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Validation error example
POST {{CIE.Api_HostAddress}}/api/prompts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "",
  "sessionId": "SESSION001",
  "promptText": ""
}

###
